## Manual testing

Single install — older version (should succeed with flag):

```
POST kbn:/api/fleet/epm/packages/crowdstrike/3.25.0
{
  "allow_outdated_version": true
}

{
  "items": [...
  ],
  "_meta": {
    "install_source": "registry",
    "name": "crowdstrike"
  }
}
```

Without flag (should return 400):

```
POST kbn:/api/fleet/epm/packages/crowdstrike/3.25.0
{}

{
  "statusCode": 400,
  "error": "Bad Request",
  "message": "crowdstrike-3.25.0 is out-of-date and cannot be installed or updated"
}
```

Bulk install:

```
POST kbn:/api/fleet/epm/packages/_bulk
{
  "packages": [{ "name": "crowdstrike", "version": "3.25.0" }],
  "allow_outdated_version": true
}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "crowdstrike",
      "version": "3.25.0",
      "result": {
        "assets": [...
        ],
        "status": "installed",
        "installType": "install",
        "installSource": "registry"
      }
    }
  ]
}


POST kbn:/api/fleet/epm/packages/_bulk
{
  "packages": [{ "name": "crowdstrike", "version": "3.25.0" }]
}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "crowdstrike",
      "statusCode": 400,
      "error": "crowdstrike-3.25.0 is out-of-date and cannot be installed or updated"
    }
  ]
}
```

